%% STATUS: IMPLEMENTED (2026-11-05, branch platform-phases).
sequenceDiagram
  participant API as Calls API
  participant O as Orchestrator
  participant A1 as Main agent
  participant L as LLM
  participant A2 as Sales agent
  participant RV as Response validator
  participant DB as Postgres
  API->>O: Turn after safety check
  O->>O: Deterministic router scores intent
  alt Router is confident
    O->>A2: Route directly
  else Router is unsure
    O->>A1: Handle turn
    A1->>L: Prompt
    L-->>A1: Reply with proposed destination sales
    A1-->>O: Proposal and reason
    O->>O: Check allowed-handoff matrix and per-call handoff cap
    alt Handoff allowed
      O->>DB: Record handoff, reason and policy result
      O->>A2: Takeover with summary of context
    else Denied or cap reached
      O-->>API: Keep current agent or offer human support
    end
  end
  A2->>L: Takeover prompt
  L-->>A2: Introduction and answer
  A2->>RV: Validate
  RV-->>O: Passed
  O->>DB: Insert agent turn with agent sales
  O-->>API: turnId, text, agent
